  "description": "Suggestions Service is a Helidon MP based Smart Platform micro service being developed as part of Saas-infra . It provides APIs to allows the sync client to synchronize the suggestions data at the client end with the database. This suggestion data is used in the VB application by smart platform to render personalization for specific user.\n\nThe table FND_SP_SUGGESTIONS is used as a persistence layer where data will flow in through the spectra ucpwrapper which acts as a data source.",
